  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_HanwhaAeroEnginesCoLtdOfSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00126566_ProvidedPaymentGuarantee10OfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">Hanwha Aero Engines Co., Ltd, Hanwha Aerospace USA Corporation, Hanwha Defense Australia Pty Ltd. 및 Hanwha Defense USA, Inc.,Hanwha Aviation Pte Ltd. 및 Hanwha Futureproof Corp. 법인의 우리은행(베트남)과 하나은행(홍콩), KB국민은행(싱가포르), 하나은행(싱가포르), 농협은행(하노이), 우리은행(뉴욕), 한국산업은행(뉴욕), 농협은행(홍콩), KEXIM (싱가포르), 하나은행(뉴욕), 신한은행(뉴욕), KB국민은행(런던), 우리은행(런던), Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A. 지급보증금액은 이자 등의 제반비용을 포함하고 있습니다.
