  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfDifferenceAmountBetweenShareCapitalAndTotalParValueDueToProfitCancellationOfDisclosureOfTheStatusOfCapitalFollowingAcquisitionAndCancellationOfTreasurySharesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTheStatusOfCapitalFollowingAcquisitionAndCancellationOfTreasurySharesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">지배회사가 발행할 주식의 총수는 200,000,000주이며, 1주당 금액은 5,000원입니다. 현재 지배회사가 발행한 유통주식수는 51,563,401주입니다. 누적으로 자기주식 2,620,655주를 매입하였으며, 2,506,042주를 소각 및 매각하여 자본금과 발행주식의 액면총액간에 12,500백만원의 차이가 발생합니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfDifferenceAmountBetweenShareCapitalAndTotalParValueDueToProfitCancellationOfDisclosureOfTheStatusOfCapitalFollowingAcquisitionAndCancellationOfTreasurySharesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTheStatusOfCapitalFollowingAcquisitionAndCancellationOfTreasurySharesTableOfItems>
