  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfWeightedAverageSharePriceTheDescriptionOfTheEffectOfPaidInCapitalIncreaseOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_CashBasedStockOptionOfRsuStockOptionOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 전기 중 진행한 유상증자의 권리락 발생에 따라 기 지급한 RSU부여액을 권리락가치 비율로 조정하였습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfWeightedAverageSharePriceTheDescriptionOfTheEffectOfPaidInCapitalIncreaseOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsTableOfItems>
