  <entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_HanwhaFutureproofCorpOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfTransactionsBetweenRelatedPartiesTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_USDMember" xml:lang="ko">Hanwha Futureproof Corp.는 연결회사의 연대 보증(채무금액의 120%)을 통해 하나은행(뉴욕), 신한은행(뉴욕), 국민은행(런던), 우리은행(런던)으로부터 4억 USD 한도의 차입 계약을 체결하였습니다. 이에 대해 연결회사는 한화솔루션㈜와 주주간 협약서를 체결하여 지분 비율인 87.5:12.5의 비율로 보증 분담하는 별도의 계약을 맺고 있습니다.</entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_HanwhaOceanCoLtdOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfTransactionsBetweenRelatedPartiesTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_USDMember" xml:lang="ko">Hanwha Aviation Pte Ltd.는 연결회사의 연대 보증(채무금액의 120%)을 통해 하나은행(싱가폴), KEXIM(싱가폴),농협은행(홍콩)으로부터 1.4억 USD 한도의 차입 계약을 체결하였습니다. 이에 대해 연결회사는 Hanwha Impact Partners Inc.와 주주간 협약서를 체결하여 지분 비율인 50:50의 비율로 보증 분담하는 별도의 계약을 맺고 있습니다.</entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_ifrs-full_KeyManagementPersonnelOfEntityOrParentMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_KRWMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기말 현재 연결회사가 경영진 등으로부터 외화지급보증 등과 관련하여 제공받고 있는 지급보증금액은 6,000,000천원이며, 실행액은 523,266천원입니다.</entity00126566:TechnologyRelatedToTransactionsInvolvingSpecialRelatedPartyGuaranteeProvisionOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
